This product is a fork of the V-Drum Explorer from Jon Skeet's DemoCode
repository (https://github.com/jskeet/DemoCode), originally located at
https://github.com/jskeet/DemoCode/tree/master/Drums.

The overwhelming majority of this codebase was authored by Jon Skeet,
including the data model, schema system, MIDI communication layer,
console application, Blazor web app, and the original WPF GUI.

This fork adds an Avalonia UI port and several UX improvements. Files
modified from the original upstream carry prominent change notices as
required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

